        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Well, what I really wanted to say is that fine-tuning of highlight groups (in particular, tree-sitter related once) is most likely will be left to user. I don't a better API, than using Neovim's builtin capabilities of `:highlight` and `:highlight link`. Those are both not verbose and flexible enough.\r\n\r\nI''ll spend a day or two pondering over this, though.",
